  <p style="margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:11px;">You received this because you're subscribed to our newsletter.</p>
</td></tr>
`)},{key:"thank-you",name:"Thank You",description:"Post-meeting or post-call thank you note",category:"follow-up",subject:"Thank you for your time — {{sender_name}}",html:Lo(`
